  "unreadable": [],
  "notes": "STEMMA QT wire colours run yellow/blue/red/black left to right in this image, so SCL is at the left end. Board silkscreen spellings that differ from the name boxes (Rst, 24, 25, G, Bat, USB, 13, 12, 11) put first in functions; silkscreen for the middle pins is hidden under the RFM module. RFM module signals (RFM_*), BUTTON (GPIO7) and NEOPIXEL (GPIO4) have no physical wiring position; RFM module castellations unlabeled, ANT (uFL) and battery connector skipped."
